agraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1574270/extras/50cfc6308d5984f18216ed51ebf847d9.poster.avif?t=1730135477\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1574270/extras/50cfc6308d5984f18216ed51ebf847d9.webm?t=1730135477\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1574270/extras/50cfc6308d5984f18216ed51ebf847d9.mp4?t=1730135477\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
